\\ UNIT 13: COMBINATORICS

binomial(10,3)       \\ Binomial coefficient
10!                  \\ Factorial
stirling(5,2)        \\ Stirling number
bell(5)              \\ Bell number
fibonacci(10)        \\ Fibonacci number
partition(10)        \\ Integer partition count
permute([1,2,3])     \\ Permute vector
nextperm([1,2,3])    \\ Next permutation
numtoperm(6,4)       \\ Convert integer to permutation
